{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1497489-spirit-influence-blood","id":1497489,"title":"Spirit Influence Blood","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-18T16:04:54-08:00","id":1497489,"title":"Spirit Influence Blood","content":"I'd like some advice regarding spirit influnece Blood - 2<br /> <br /> I'm playing a CotC acolyte and am thinking about getting a spirit guardian through the <span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Eternal Guardian of the Dark Moon. <br /> <br /> I'm figuring out which way to go and have recently seen Blood as an idea for influence. So the guardian would be a spirit of blood. Which rather fits a vampire. <br /> <br /> Am wondering what this influence could do at level 1 and level 2.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> \u2022 Strengthen The spirit can enhance its sphere of influence: make an emotion stronger, an<br /> animal or plant healthier or an object more robust (gaining an extra point of<br /> Health or Structure per Rank of the spirit, for example). These changes last for<br /> one minute per success. The cost is one Essence.<br /> <br /> \u2022\u2022 Manipulate The spirit can make minor changes within its sphere of influence, such as to<br /> slightly change the nature or target of an emotion, or make minor changes<br /> to an animal\u2019s actions, a plant\u2019s growth or an object\u2019s functioning.<br /> <br /> So what would you say the uses for these could be if influence is blood.<br /> <br /> <br /> Also am open to suggestions with regards to numina.<br /> <br /> br<br /> Salarion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27553-salarion","name":"Salarion","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-18T19:25:52-08:00","id":1497502,"title":"","content":"Maybe you have an additional Vitae every time you feed. The spirit \u2018amplifies\u2019 your meal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-18T20:14:27-08:00","id":1497504,"title":"","content":"A notice: Vitae is not blood. That said, strengthen can increase the amount of blood to transmute into VItae, and Manipulate could make it resistant to transmutation, or otherwise jerking around a spilled blood where it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T16:36:18-08:00","id":1497583,"title":"","content":"Then maybe it purges the blood drank of all toxins, diseases, etc, of a mundane nature?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://for